# NexaTech — Build the NexaConnect Universal Connector Platform

I am building **NexaTech**, an AI-powered business operating layer that connects to the software businesses already use.

I need you to build the **NexaConnect connector architecture**.

The goal is NOT to hard-code every integration independently.

The goal is to create a scalable connector framework where Microsoft 365, Google Workspace, QuickBooks, Zoho, Square, Shopify, payroll systems, ERP systems, SQL databases, files, and future software can all connect to NexaTech through a standardized interface.

---

# 1. CORE PRINCIPLE

External systems must NEVER be referenced directly throughout the NexaTech application.

Use this architecture:

```text
External Business Systems
        ↓
     NexaConnect
        ↓
Connector Adapters
        ↓
Mapping / Normalization
        ↓
Universal NexaTech Objects
        ↓
NexaTech Core
        ↓
AI / Analytics / Workflows
        ↓
Permission + Action Layer
        ↓
External Systems
```

Every external platform must implement the same standardized connector interface.

