# 2. BUILD A NEXACONNECT SDK

Create a reusable connector interface similar to:

```typescript
interface NexaConnector {
    id: string;
    provider: string;
    version: string;

    authenticate(): Promise<AuthResult>;

    disconnect(): Promise<void>;

    testConnection(): Promise<ConnectionStatus>;

    getCapabilities(): Promise<CapabilityManifest>;

    fetchRecords(
        objectType: string,
        options?: FetchOptions
    ): Promise<RecordBatch>;

    getRecord?(
        objectType: string,
        externalId: string
    ): Promise<ExternalRecord>;

    createRecord?(
        objectType: string,
        data: unknown
    ): Promise<ExternalRecord>;

    updateRecord?(
        objectType: string,
        externalId: string,
        data: unknown
    ): Promise<ExternalRecord>;

    subscribeEvents?(): Promise<WebhookSubscription>;

    healthCheck(): Promise<ConnectorHealth>;
}
```

Individual providers should extend/implement this interface.

Do NOT allow provider-specific code to leak into NexaTech Core.

