# 16. READ VS WRITE SAFETY

Treat READ and WRITE separately.

For example:

```text
invoice.read
```

does NOT automatically grant:

```text
invoice.write
```

High-impact actions should require explicit permission.

Examples:

```text
sending email
creating invoice
changing inventory
editing payroll
issuing payment
deleting records
```

Create an approval mechanism.

Example:

```text
AI proposes action
       ↓
Permission check
       ↓
Approval required?
       ↓
User confirms
       ↓
Connector executes
       ↓
Audit log
```

---

# 17. AI RULE

Do NOT use AI for deterministic calculations.

Examples:

```text
invoice totals
inventory counts
financial calculations
dates
payment totals
KPI calculations
```

These should be calculated using code/database queries.

AI should be used for:

```text
summarization
classification
explanation
natural-language queries
document understanding
draft generation
workflow suggestions
```

